# Build-context allowlist for deploy/runpod/Dockerfile only (BuildKit reads
# <Dockerfile>.dockerignore). Research checkpoints, models, reports, backups and
# env files never enter the context. C0 comes from deploy/runpod/build/c0,
# produced by stage_c0.sh from committed Git blobs.
*
!apps/api/
!apps/web/
!apps/ai-service/
!deploy/migrations/
!deploy/runpod/Dockerfile
!deploy/runpod/rootfs/
!deploy/runpod/build/c0/

**/node_modules
**/dist
**/coverage
**/.vite
**/.vitest-cache
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache
**/.venv
**/venv
apps/api/bin
apps/api/tmp
apps/ai-service/tests
**/.DS_Store
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
